# Agent framework + cache (large / transient; never commit)
# Exception: _bmad/custom/ is our team override layer — committed so our
# customizations survive `bmad update` and stay reviewable. (*.user.toml stays
# local via _bmad/custom/.gitignore.) The disposable base install stays ignored.
_bmad/*
!_bmad/custom/
.claude/
shells/
_bmad-output/runtime/
_bmad-output/story-automator/
.claude/.story-automator-active
